Package: FAMasv
Type: Package
Title: Species-Resolved Household Sharing of Amplicon Sequence Variants
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("bingzhang@ucas.ac.cn", email = "bingzhang@ucas.ac.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: bingzhang@ucas.ac.cn [aut, cre]
Maintainer: bingzhang@ucas.ac.cn <bingzhang@ucas.ac.cn>
Description: Quantifies identical amplicon sequence variant sharing and
    within-species Jaccard similarity in paired households. Uses carrier-restricted
    one-to-one permutations with no original household matches, separate
    multiple-testing correction for both metrics, and household bootstraps for
    visualization. Includes de-identified oral example data,
    transparent parameters, species
    selection, and batch figure and table export.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), stats, utils, grDevices, methods
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), phyloseq
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
